3. ATTRIBUTION — THE CONDITION OF THIS LICENCE

   If you Distribute The Software or any Derivative Work, you MUST credit
   MLMVPN, in all three of the following places that apply to what you ship:

   (a) IN THE PRODUCT ITSELF.
