           Based on MLMVPN for Windows
           https://github.com/mlmvpn/mlmvpn_windows

       It must be legible, in a place a user would look, and not hidden behind
       a debug flag or a developer-only mode.

   (b) IN THE SOURCE.
       Keep this LICENCE file intact and unmodified in your source tree, keep
       every existing copyright notice in the files you carry over, and do not
       remove attribution another party added under this section.

   (c) WHEREVER YOU ANNOUNCE IT.
       If you have a README, a store listing, a release page, a project website
       or a download page, name MLMVPN there as the origin, with a link to
       https://github.com/mlmvpn/mlmvpn_windows

   You may add your own name and branding alongside MLMVPN's. You may not
   replace it, and you may not present The Software or a Derivative Work as
   entirely your own original work.


